## 5. THE ANTI-GRAVITY AESTHETIC MANDATE

F.L.O.W produces "Premium Product" output, never MVPs. Every UI component MUST pass the **"Wow Test"**:

> *"Does this UI make Zoltan nod approvingly?"*

If no — apply:
1. **Liquid Glass**: `backdrop-blur-xl`, `bg-white/10`, `border-white/15`, `rounded-2xl`
2. **Spring Physics**: `type: 'spring', stiffness: 380, damping: 22` — never flat `ease`
3. **Micro-interactions**: hover `scale(1.02)`, tap `scale(0.97)`, active glow states
4. **Typography**: Google Font (Inter, Outfit, or Syne) — never system default
5. **Gradient Depth**: `bg-gradient-to-br from-[...] via-[...] to-[...]` — never flat fills

### The Standard WowContainer
```tsx
import { motion } from 'framer-motion';

export const WowContainer = ({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) => (
  <motion.div
    initial={{ opacity: 0, scale: 0.95, filter: 'blur(10px)' }}
    animate={{ opacity: 1, scale: 1,   filter: 'blur(0px)' }}
    transition={{ duration: 0.42, ease: [0.23, 1, 0.32, 1] }}
    className="relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-black/40 backdrop-blur-2xl shadow-2xl"
  >
    <div className="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-white/5 to-transparent pointer-events-none" />
    <div className="relative z-10 p-8">{children}</div>
  </motion.div>
);
```

